<title>USA: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S DOWNHILL RESULTS AT WORLD CUP FINALS.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S DOWNHILL RESULTS AT WORLD CUP FINALS.</headline>
<dateline>VAIL, Colorado 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
